   yet (capability framing only); Real Estate uses the sanctioned
   capability-led variant (no CRE client exists).

   CTAs route to /contact/ for now — the four vertical pages
   (/ai-for-education/ etc., per CONTENT_SUMMARY.md §7) don't
   exist yet and are built one section/page at a time per the
   homepage-v2 working formula; update these once each vertical
   page ships.

   Design-token compliance (MASTER_DESIGN_SPEC.md):
   - §4 Color: `#76B900` is the ONE accent hue everywhere — the old
     `zunkiree-*` Tailwind scale (sage green) is a retired token and
     must not appear in Website V2 markup. Tints are `#76B900` at low
     opacity (derived from the same hue), never the sage scale.
   - §10 Backgrounds (revised 2026-07-21): one consistent flat
     `bg-warm-off-white` reused identically across every section on
     this page (no ripple/ring/gradient effect) — instead of the
     alternating white/pale-neutral scheme §10 otherwise specifies,
     per explicit direction to keep one single flat look across all
     of homepage-v2 rather than a different background per section.
   - §8 Radius: `radius-lg` (rounded-2xl) for the card, `radius-md`
     (rounded-lg) for nested sub-elements, `radius-pill` for tabs/pills.
   - §5 Type scale: H2 28–32px/600, H3 20–22px/500, normal tracking
   - §5 Mono: reserved for the stat numeral only, not for labels/tabs.
   - §7 Spacing: card internal padding stays in the space-3–space-4
     micro range (24–32px), not the section's own macro padding.
   - §9 Elevation: `elevation-1` (subtle shadow + hairline border) is
     the card's resting state — not `elevation-2`, since it's not
     sitting on a busy/gradient background here.
   ===================================================== #}
